WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.190
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.310
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.070
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.900
Shining Finger

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.780
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:17.160
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.620
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:26.290
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:32.550
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.970
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:48.310
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.610
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:55.110
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:58.200
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:02.200
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:03.950
Bright you now

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.460
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:10.790
Shining Finger

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.460
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:16.010
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:26.140
Now, everybody...

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.100
It's been eleven long months
since the start of...

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.770
...the exciting 13th Gundam Fight.

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:34.690
The Final Battle between
the Gundam Fighters...

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:37.400
...who have all shown their worth
by surviving thus far...

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.950
...is finally about to commence.

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.580
And where will the Finals be held?

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.330
Yes. Here, in Neo Hong Kong.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:47.370
And now!

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:52.040
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:58.510
All Fighters Gathered!
The Final Battles Begin

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.720
<i>Take a look at this!</i>

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:09.480
<i>In this specially-built stadium, counting</i>
<i>down to the opening ceremonies</i>...

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.810
...<i>we can feel the extraordinary</i>
<i>ex citement in the air!</i>

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.020
<i>And no wonder</i>.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:16.320
<i>Colony leaders from all</i>
<i>nations of the world</i>...

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.820
...<i>are gathering here</i>...

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:20.740
...<i>and making courtesy visits</i>
<i>to the one leader</i>...

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.320
...<i>who currently rules all of space</i>...

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:25.870
...<i>Neo Hong Kong's</i>
<i>Prime Minister Wong Yun Fat</i>.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.540
Now, then...

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.790
...it's time for the party to begin.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:37.800
Domon.

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:40.380
I commend you on a fine job...

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:41.260
...of defeating the Devil Gundam.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.590
Thanks to you, Domon...

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:46.970
...we were able to save the United
Colony Federation from danger.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:49.020
I take this opportunity
to thank you.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.060
However!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:53.350
You mustn't forget that
your most important battle...

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:54.900
...is just beginning!

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.770
You don't have to remind me!

00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:00.120
I'll win this championship!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.990
To save my father!

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:09.200
<i>Now, at last</i>...

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:13.080
...<i>the battle that all of space is</i>
<i>focusing on has finally begun</i>.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.290
<i>After surviving their battles</i>
<i>to make it to the Final</i>...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:19.010
...<i>the noble warriors are ready</i>
<i>to enter with their Gundams!</i>

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.800
<i>Our first Gundam, representing</i>
<i>Neo America</i>...

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.720
...<i>is the Gundam Maxter!</i>

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.010
<i>With its strong armor</i>
<i>and amazing agility</i>...

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:29.270
...<i>this is an aggressive machine</i>
<i>that will challenge any opponent!</i>

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.270
<i>Its Gigantic Magnum</i>
<i>will never miss its target!</i>

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.320
<i>Its Cyclone Punch</i>
<i>will knock out the wind!</i>

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.610
Take this!

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.330
<i>Its ultimate technique, with fists</i>
<i>of fire, is the Burning Punch!</i>

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.420
<i>The Gundam Fighter piloting</i>
<i>this Gundam</i>...

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:59.670
...<i>is the undefeated boxing champion</i>
<i>with 100 wins in 100 bouts!</i>

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:02.880
Space Colony
Neo America

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.510
<i>Chibodee Crocket!</i>

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.060
I'll do it!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.970
I'll win the championship...

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:13.850
...and make my American
dream come true.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.270
Then I'll light up the city
as the local boy...

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.610
...who became the star of hope!

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:23.650
<i>The second Gundam</i>...

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.570
...<i>representing Neo China</i>
<i>is the Dragon Gundam!</i>

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:30.330
Sai Saici. Focus!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.540
Don't forget to focus!

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:37.420
<i>This machine is the culmination</i>
<i>of four thousand years of history!</i>

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:38.920
<i>These teeth will crush anything!</i>

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.630
<i>The steel fangs of the Dragon Claws!</i>

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:48.340
<i>This technique will immobilize</i>
<i>the enemy! The Feilong Flags!</i>

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:54.890
<i>These flames will burn anything</i>
<i>in their way!</i>

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.520
<i>The Dragon Fire!</i>

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>The Fighter who has mastered</i>
<i>these techniques</i>...

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:06.900
...<i>is the youngest Gundam Fighter</i>
<i>in the world, Sai Saici!</i>

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.910
This championship is mine!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.370
Dear Dad and Grandpa watching
over me from heaven...

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.290
...it won't be long before...

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.780
...the Shaolin Temple
is resurrected supreme!

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.130
<i>The next Gundam is</i>...

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:24.920
<i>Huh?</i>

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.800
<i>Could that gorgeous machine be</i>... <i>?</i>

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:27.880
<i>Yes!</i>

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.760
<i>It's the Gundam Rose,</i>
<i>representing Neo France!</i>

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.780
<i>The elegant chivalrous saber!</i>

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:47.200
<i>Beautiful roses have their thorns!</i>

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.910
<i>Its finishing move is the Rose Bits!</i>

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.460
And now, for a demonstration!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.670
Rose Screamer!

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:08.260
<i>This ex citing Fighter, the brave</i>
<i>young master of the de Sand family</i>...

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.430
...<i>George de Sand!</i>

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.390
Miss Maria Louise...

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:13.600
I, George de Sand...

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.470
Space Colony
Neo France

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:16.140
...will never let you down.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.690
In order to protect the honor
and dignity of our nation...

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:25.610
...I will capture the Gundam Fight
championship for you!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.450
<i>Appearing next,</i>
<i>representing Neo Russia</i>...

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.620
...<i>is the Bolt Gundam!</i>

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.960
<i>The tremendous power of its</i>
<i>heavy-duty Victor engines</i>...

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.960
...<i>makes it a cut above</i>
<i>all Gundams!</i>

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.470
<i>One hit by the giant iron ball</i>...

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.810
...<i>the Graviton Hammer,</i>
<i>is enough to crush any opponent!</i>

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:10.240
<i>And the Fighter operating</i>
<i>this Gundam is in fact</i>...

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.110
...<i>the feared pirate</i>
<i>of outer space</i>...

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:15.410
...<i>Argo Gulskii!</i>

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.200
<i>Just like his crew who are</i>
<i>locked up in prison</i>...

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.330
...<i>Argo is also a prisoner!</i>

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.630
This is where it counts...

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.030
...Argo Gulskii.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:35.680
I'll win the championship,
regardless of your orders.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.560
And when I'm finished...

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:40.430
...you will fulfill
your promise by...

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.560
...freeing my friends!

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.400
<i>I need to ask for your silence now!</i>

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.610
<i>Which country does the</i>
<i>next Gundam represent?</i>

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:05.330
<i>Neo Japan is here with their</i>
<i>new model, the God Gundam</i>.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.290
<i>A martial artist from</i>
<i>the Colony</i>...

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:12.110
...<i>and the "King of Hearts,"</i>
<i>Fighter Domon Kasshu!</i>

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:14.380
<i>How will he compete in</i>
<i>a machine that is new to him?</i>

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.140
<i>This could be very interesting!</i>

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:20.810
God Gundam...

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.560
...you are the Shining Gundam's
alter ego.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.770
Shining Gundam...

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:43.660
...you continued the battle with me.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:00.930
Super Mode
Shining Gundam

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:05.270
You trained me through your
Super Mode, Shining Gundam.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:10.440
You kept on fighting,
right until the very end.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.730
With Rain.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.480
That's right, Domon.

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.900
As long as you're safe...

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.240
...that's all I ask for.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.700
Sh-Shining Gundam!

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:25.620
But why?!

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:28.420
Domon!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:29.630
Don't give up!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:36.420
Transfer Shining Gundam's
data to God Gundam!

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:36.970
Rain!

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.110
Shining Gundam...

00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:58.660
Please!

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:03.530
Watch over me always,
as I continue to fight.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:08.410
The combat data from
our many Fights will live on!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:09.290
Yes!

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.250
Shining Gundam...

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.590
...and now God Gundam and I...

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.800
...are three-in-one!

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:25.770
<i>Now, these five pilots we've</i>
<i>just introduced</i>...

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:29.730
...<i>are each rumored</i>
<i>to possess a Shuffle Crest</i>.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:31.210
<i>Proof that they are all</i>
<i>top Fighters</i>.

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:34.380
<i>This only increases the expectations</i>
<i>of this thrilling competition!</i>

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:36.990
So...

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.700
...are you saying that the
one we are looking for...

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.370
...the strongest Fighter of all,
is among those five?

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:43.660
That's right.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:48.450
But look at the powerful line-up
from the other countries.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.510
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:04.550
<i>Now!</i>
<i>Take a look at this!</i>

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:08.140
<i>The next Gundam is powerful</i>
<i>Zeus Gundam from Neo Greece!</i>

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.710
<i>It's truly majestic, isn't it?</i>

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:14.730
<i>Next, we have the Nether Gundam</i>
<i>from Neo Holland!</i>

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:17.860
<i>We shall see how fearsome</i>
<i>its tremendous windmill is!</i>

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:20.570
<i>This next Gundam is sure</i>
<i>to show us great power!</i>

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.200
<i>Matador Gundam from Neo Spain!</i>

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:28.200
<i>Viking Gundam of Neo Norway</i>
<i>has sailed the seas to join us here!</i>

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.000
<i>Neo Nepal's Mandala Gundam!</i>

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.960
<i>Neo Denmark's</i>
<i>Mermaid Gundam!</i>

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.420
<i>Neo India's</i>
<i>Cobra Gundam!</i>

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.920
<i>Neo Kenya's</i>
<i>Gundam Zebra!</i>

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.210
<i>And</i>...

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:42.380
<i>The next Gundam</i>
<i>is about to enter!</i>

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:53.520
I expected you here,
Andrew Graham.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.480
You've come to take me on,
have you?

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.950
If you wish to fight against me...

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.700
...I'll accept your
challenge anytime!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:14.580
Neo Canada's Lumber Gundam!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:20.590
Argo...

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:25.090
...looks like you've got a tricky
opponent to face.

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:26.220
However...

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:36.730
I see we've all somehow made it
to the Final Battle safely.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.190
Gundam Spiegel...

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.020
...It's Schwarz Bruder.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:41.070
So, you're alive!

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.820
And so are you.

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.570
It's good to see you
made it here, monsieur.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.370
Thanks for saving us at the
Guyana Highlands!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.370
You sure saved our hides.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.410
I owe you.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.540
Oh, don't mention it.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.460
I'm just happy that I'll be
able to fight you men.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.500
Especially you, Domon Kasshu.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:12:59.590
Yeah.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.970
But I'm really glad that
you're all right.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.430
Yes.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.680
You sure took care of me
at the Guyana Highlands.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.600
Wh-what's going on?

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:19.590
The spirit of Meikyo Shisui.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.360
Listen.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:23.990
A serene state of mind without
ill feelings or a guilty conscience.

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:25.820
That's Meikyo Shisui.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:30.700
It gives one the ability
to surpass his own skills.

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:33.200
And that's what activates
the Super Mode.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:38.490
That's right.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:42.170
You taught me so many lessons.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.590
But in the end...

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.470
You even went so far as to
risk your life to save me.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:55.890
Why?!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.520
Who are you really?!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.400
I'm a Gundam Fighter
from Neo Germany.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.860
That's all that matters.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.230
More importantly, look at that!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.200
Neros Gundam
and John Bull Gundam?!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.660
Michelo Chariot and
Gentle Chapman, huh?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.670
But I know I defeated
both of them myself!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.010
You're right!

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.930
I saw it happen with
my own eyes!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.060
It's a major breach
of Fight regulations...

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:39.390
...for any disqualified Gundam
to take part in the Final Battle!

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.100
I'll tell the authorities!

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:41.770
Wait!

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.270
There's a major player
about to be introduced!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.290
That's...

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:01.500
I-it couldn't be...!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:07.380
Here we go, Fuun Saiki!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.600
It is him!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:26.690
Master Gundam?!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:28.940
<i>That's right!</i>

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:32.410
<i>This Fighter is the Undefeated</i>
<i>of the East, Master Asia!</i>

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:37.830
<i>The defending champion</i>
<i>of the 12th Gundam Fight</i>...

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.620
...<i>where he earned Neo Hong</i>
<i>Kong the right to rule space!</i>

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:43.330
<i>This time in the formidable</i>
<i>Master Gundam</i>...

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:47.090
...<i>he has arrived on his beloved</i>
<i>and powerful horse, Fuun Saiki!</i>

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.550
<i>We, in Neo Hong Kong,</i>
<i>owe our success to this man!</i>

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:53.300
<i>I'm sure everybody here is</i>
<i>aware of his amazing abilities!</i>

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:54.760
<i>Yes! Rumor has it that</i>...

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:59.310
...<i>Master Asia easily defeated</i>
<i>a mysterious mobile suit army</i>...

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:02.130
...<i>that suddenly attacked</i>
<i>Shinjuku, Tokyo in Neo Japan</i>...

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:06.520
...<i>and demonstrated his amazing</i>
<i>fighting with his bare hands!</i>

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.750
<i>Isn't he amazing?</i>

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.120
<i>What's even more surprising</i>...

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:26.830
...<i>are rumors that he is master</i>
<i>to Neo Japan's Domon Kasshu</i>.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:30.170
<i>We are told that the team play</i>
<i>of these two is breathtaking!</i>

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.670
Chokyu!

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.050
Haoh!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:36.590
Deneidan!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.720
Chokyu Haoh Deneidan

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.940
Shoot, Domon!

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.940
Yes, sir!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:55.910
Explode!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.870
It's true.
You used to be my master.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:04.290
But last I remember,
we severed those ties!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.020
That's right.

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:24.430
I'm positive I defeated you.

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:25.730
Then why?

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:28.270
Answer me!
Undefeated of the East!

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.520
Shut up!

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:32.030
You're speaking nonsense!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.820
I'm right here, as you can see.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.860
What's so hard to believe
about that?!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:36.990
Listen!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:38.780
In this 13th Tournament...

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:41.870
...you will first all compete in
matches against each other...

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.830
...after which the top Fighters
will be determined!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.250
Then, the Battle Royale...

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.580
...will be held at Lantau Island...

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.540
...to determine the true champion!

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:53.870
But I'm warning all of you now!

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.420
As the most experienced Fighter...

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:58.430
...I'll be waiting there for you.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:01.550
I will then crush you all and...

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:05.020
...rather than merely being the
Undefeated of the East...

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.020
East

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:05.640
West

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.850
...I will become the
Ultimate Champion...

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:06.270
South

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:06.930
North

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:08.350
...Undefeated of the East, West,
South, North and Center.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:09.900
I will become Super Asia...

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.560
...and be champion of all!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:14.780
East!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:15.350
West!

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:15.850
South!

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:16.360
North!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.450
And Center?!

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:19.610
In that case...

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:21.240
...I'm making a declaration!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.790
Just so I can defeat you...

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:26.290
...I'll win every one of
my preliminary matches!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:27.580
What?!

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.330
What about the rest of us?!

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.890
Who does he think he is?!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.040
What the...?

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:34.420
That Neo Japan.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.260
He's really got quite some nerve!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:38.680
He thinks he's way better
than the rest of us.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.840
Domon is getting ahead of himself.

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:44.510
<i>Now, now, the opening ceremonies</i>
<i>are all about harmony</i>.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.350
<i>Don't waste your energy now</i>...

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:49.440
...<i>as you'll need it in battle</i>
<i>tomorrow to prove your abilities</i>.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.150
<i>Isn't that so?</i>

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:56.610
<i>Prime Minister Wong has a few words</i>
<i>to say at the opening ceremonies!</i>

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:08.080
<i>To the Fighters undefeated</i>
<i>over the past eleven months</i>...

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.370
...<i>I wish to congratulate you</i>.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.500
<i>However</i>...

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.670
...<i>things will likely become</i>
<i>more difficult from now on</i>.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:16.550
<i>The reason being</i>...

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:19.960
...<i>that you will all have to</i>
<i>abide by the three new rules</i>...

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:21.880
...<i>for the Final Battle</i>.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:23.140
What's this?!

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:24.390
<i>Firstly!</i>

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:27.640
<i>The Gundams in the Final Battle</i>...

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:31.100
...<i>may be replaced, repaired,</i>
<i>and reconstructed without limit!</i>

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.350
<i>Secondly!</i>

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.820
<i>The cockpit may be targeted</i>...

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.150
...<i>by any means!</i>

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.440
Th-that's crazy!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.280
The Fighter could lose his life!

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:42.160
Is he out of his mind?!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.370
That rule's a bit extreme!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.120
So, what's the last rule?!

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:48.540
<i>Thirdly!</i>

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:52.080
<i>The remaining Gundam who</i>
<i>has won the Battle Royale</i>...

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.920
...<i>complete with these rules</i>...

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:57.130
...<i>shall then be given title,</i>
<i>Gundam of the Gundams!</i>

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.760
<i>To commemorate these</i>
<i>ceremonies today</i>...

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:06.800
...<i>I'd like to call upon Neo Hong</i>
<i>Kong's Master Gundam</i>...

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:10.060
...<i>and Neo Japan's God Gundam</i>
<i>to demonstrate their skills</i>.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.020
Right!

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.270
Here I go, Domon!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.860
Come on! Undefeated of the East!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.070
The school of...

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:24.030
...the Undefeated of the East!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.200
The winds of the king!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:27.950
Z enshin!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.120
Keiretsu!

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.950
Tempa Kyoran!

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.290
Look!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.630
The East is burning red!

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:48.970
Domon...

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.390
...do you hate me?

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:52.560
If you hate me, come at me.

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:56.000
Come at me as a member
of the Shuffle Alliance!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.520
Let the Fight begin!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:15.370
We, the Gundam Fighters...

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:18.960
...hereby swear that we will fight
to the best of our abilities...

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:23.260
...for the purpose of attaining
the glory of becoming...

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.550
...the Gundam of Gundams!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:26.970
<i>Very well then!</i>

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:30.640
<i>I am pleased to hereby declare</i>
<i>the Final Battle of the</i>...

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:32.640
...<i>13th Gundam Fight now open!</i>

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.610
So, it has finally begun.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:42.860
Yes.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:44.570
It all begins here.

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:45.950
Domon...

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.960
Dad, I...

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:01.210
...I will definitely...
I will definitely save you.

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:04.710
No matter what kind of trap the
Undefeated of the East will set...

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:06.340
...I will win the championship.

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:09.300
I swear, on the name of
the King of Hearts!

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:11.390
With the God Gundam!

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:12.550
We'll win!

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:33.330
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:37.710
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:42.170
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:45.710
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:58.600
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:03.860
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:10.410
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:14.530
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:20.540
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:35.390
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:37.970
It's God Gundam's first match.

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:40.810
The dangerous opponent
is Z eus Gundam.

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:44.150
Domon gets into a pinch against
the fierce power of his opponent!

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:47.530
But Domon's fist burns red
and roars...

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:50.610
...telling him to defeat his enemy.

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:53.320
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:57.490
A New Weapon!
Erupting God Finger!

00:23:54.950 --> 00:24:02.100
A New Weapon!
Erupting God Finger!

00:23:57.490 --> 00:24:00.200
Ready! Go!
